    {
      "id": "2126511730377232730",
      "text": "Wrote about LeBron James' tremendous surge continuing, Joel Embiid's return to action and two-man work with Tyrese Maxey, Dominick Barlow's pristine fit alongside James & Embiid, harrowing hamstrings, more. Including... THE SIXERS WON THEIR NBA CUP GROUP: https://t.co/RNOza1nyTT",
