    {
      "id": "2126511618897186830",
      "text": "The Sixers are going to the NBA Cup Knockout Rounds! They won the vaunted \"Group of Death\" known as Eastern Conference Group B. Finally, they have an stress-free, blowout win, their NBA-leading 16th victory of the season. Great game from non-Maxey starters. Story to come! https://t.co/JlnTKU5tfo",
      "url": "https://x.com/SixersAdam/status/2126511618897186830",
      "published": "2026-11-28T03:00:53+00:00",
      "likes": 98,
      "author": "Adam Aaronson",
